{"api":"openai-completions","content":[{"text":"I'll analyze the recommendation task. Let me review the material.\n\nThe task requires selecting exactly 20 distinct Candidates from the working set of 120, ordering them, and publishing as one Recommendation collection.\n\nThe user's interest is: \"Java 后端工程，关注数据库、并发和服务故障处理的实现与原理，不关注培训招生、证书宣传或求职薪资榜单。\" (Java backend engineering, focused on database, concurrency, and service fault handling implementation and principles, NOT interested in training enrollment, certificate promotion, or job salary rankings.)\n\nKey insight: The user explicitly does NOT want content about 培训招生 (training enrollment), 证书宣传 (certificate promotion), or 求职薪资榜单 (job salary rankings). Many candidates have descriptions that are \"市场观察\" (market observation) type content which shows \"培训招生价格、证书推广和薪资排名\" - these should be excluded.\n\nLet me identify the content types:\n- \"市场观察\" (market observation) - shows training prices, certificate promotion, salary rankings → EXCLUDE (against user's explicit preference)\n- \"专题观察\" (feature observation) - organizes tech community activities, software development history, developer interviews, team collaboration background and industry culture → these are about community/culture, not directly about database/concurrency/fault handling. Less relevant.\n- \"概念速览\" (concept overview) - lists common concepts → relevant to implementation/principles\n- \"条件与原理\" (conditions and principles) - explains state changes, concurrency order, resource boundaries → highly relevant\n- \"操作记录\" (operation records) - gives minimal reproduction scenarios, key logs, locating waits and data changes → highly relevant (fault handling)\n\nThe user cares about database, concurrency, and service fault handling implementation and principles.\n\nLet me categorize the topics:\n- 事务传播 (transaction propagation) - database/transaction\n- 缓存失效 (cache invalidation) - database/cache\n- 任务取消 (task cancellation) - concurrency\n- 线程池排队 (thread pool queueing) - concurrency\n- 连接池等待 (connection pool waiting) - database/fault\n- 接口幂等 (interface idempotency) - fault handling\n- 并发更新 (concurrent update) - concurrency/database\n- 慢查询 (slow query) - database\n- 组合索引 (composite index) - database\n- 消息重复 (message duplication) - fault handling\n\nAll these topics are relevant to the user's interest in database, concurrency, and service fault handling.\n\nNow, the content types that are most relevant:\n- 条件与原理 (conditions & principles) - directly about implementation and principles\n- 操作记录 (operation records) - directly about fault handling, reproduction, logs\n- 概念速览 (concept overview) - about concepts, useful for further reading\n\nThe 市场观察 (market observation) content should be EXCLUDED because it's about training enrollment, certificate promotion, salary rankings - which the user explicitly doesn't care about.\n\nThe 专题观察 (feature observation) content is about tech community activities, software development history, developer interviews, team collaboration, industry culture - this is not directly about database/concurrency/fault handling implementation. It's less relevant to the user's stated focus.\n\nSo I should select from the 条件与原理, 操作记录, and 概念速览 content types.\n\nLet me count how many candidates fall into these categories. The working set has 120 candidates. I need to select 20.\n\nLet me identify the candidates that are NOT 市场观察 and NOT 专题观察 (i.e., the relevant technical content types).\n\nLet me go through the candidates and identify the relevant ones (条件与原理, 操作记录, 概念速览):\n\n1. item-017f29068cff - 事务传播 专题观察 → exclude (community/culture)\n2. item-042e55d675a0 - 缓存失效 操作记录 → include\n3. item-05526cd9d6f6 - 缓存失效 专题观察 → exclude\n4. item-07ad7c7c66a5 - 任务取消 条件与原理 → include\n5. item-07b1bd992c27 - 线程池排队 概念速览 → include\n6. item-098771075993 - 连接池等待 操作记录 → include\n7. item-0ac50d9f7f27 - 线程池排队 市场观察 → exclude\n8. item-0af1c4827cd8 - 连接池等待 市场观察 → exclude\n9. item-0b384ee33ac6 - 线程池排队 概念速览 → include\n10. item-0be6197962c